# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts convert LF to CRLF on disk, and every export
# from build-plugin.ps1 then shows all 1365 lines of Eva's SKILL.md as modified
# even when nothing changed. That makes the diff useless for review, which
# matters because reviewing the diff is the safeguard before publishing to a
# public marketplace.
* text=auto eol=lf
